# Style for the C++ solution files in this repo.
#
# The existing .cpp files were already written in clang-format's LLVM default
# style (2-space indent, 80-column limit), so this pins that rather than
# introducing a new one — reformatting is a no-op on committed code.
#
# Note: this file only takes effect if your editor's C++ formatter is told to
# use it. See .vscode/settings.json in this repo.
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
